# Passes every STATIC check but is unsafe at RUNTIME. A continuous infusion has
# no declared end, so MAX_TOTAL cannot be proven statically for it; only the
# VM's simulation (24 hr horizon) sees 12 mg/hr x 24 hr = 288 mg > 150 mg.
PATIENT p1 { WEIGHT: 70 kg; }
DRUG dopamine { MAX_RATE: 20 mg/hr; MAX_TOTAL: 150 mg; }
DRUG morphine { MAX_RATE: 4 mg/hr;  MAX_TOTAL: 60 mg; }

INFUSION base FOR p1 USING dopamine AT 12 mg/hr;
REPEAT bolus FOR p1 USING morphine AT 3 mg/hr EVERY 6 hr UNTIL 24 hr OVER 2 hr;
